From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Feb 2026 20:44:15 +0530
Subject: Fix override bridge timing, pass thisArg in GenericBuiltinWrapper,
 rewrite __rUA registration

Three related fixes for the override hook system:

1. Bridge timing: Split InstallV8BuiltinOverrides into two phases:
   - InstallOverrideBridge() installs __ro/__rov/__rUA BEFORE
     DidCreateScriptContext, so preload scripts can register overrides
     via contextBridge.executeInMainWorld() during context creation
   - InstallV8BuiltinOverrides() installs V8 built-in wrappers (Math,
     Date, etc.) AFTER, so overrides are already registered when
     wrappers start intercepting calls

2. GenericBuiltinWrapper now appends info.This() as the last argument
   to override callbacks: (result, ...originalArgs, thisArg). This
   allows Date prototype method overrides (toString, getTimezoneOffset,
   etc.) to access the Date instance for per-tab timezone reformatting.
   Backwards-compatible since existing overrides ignore extra trailing args.

3. Rewrite RegisterUACallback (__rUA) to read JS object fields manually
   instead of using NativeValueTraits<UAOverrideValues>, populating
   UAOverrideManager storage directly. Sets fallback storage so service
   workers and new frames inherit overrides.

